Q("The attrition read shows:", ["Names and blame", "Leavers by reason, unit, and tenure band — figures to the owner", "Salaries", "Interviews verbatim"], 1, "The numbers say who; the interviews say why.", "Ch5"),
Q("The probation lapse-by-silence is prevented by:", ["Longer probations", "The monthly read of end dates — every end date gets a dated decision on the record", "Shorter probations", "No probations"], 1, "The failure mode named.", "Ch6"),
