Q("The quarterly reconciliation checks:", ["Salaries", "Every line has its document and every lifecycle document has its line — both ways", "The org chart", "The calendar"], 1, "The standing both-ways read.", "Ch7"),
Q("A late-executed event is entered:", ["With today's effective date", "With its true effective date and its true entry date, the gap noted — the honest-date lane", "Backdated silently", "Skipped"], 1, "The arrears pattern for organisational changes.", "Ch7"),
Q("A wrong transfer is fixed by:", ["Cancelling to rewrite", "A correcting transfer with its cause noted — documents are never cancelled to rewrite outcomes", "Direct edits", "Deletion"], 1, "History discipline rule 2.", "Ch7"),
Q("HealthTrade's transfer fired which compliance line:", ["None", "Cold Chain — the destination role's population obligation from the move date", "Fire safety", "Dispensing"], 1, "The mover rule executed.", "Ch8"),
